From 69903a894c4fe3607fc46d14c13ac0c1099068e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aiaimimi0920 <153103332+aiaimimi0920@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 01:01:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(runtime): release Process OS resources

Close process and thread handles after exit and unregister Process-owned PIDs when the wrapper is released. This prevents per-child handle and process-map growth during long sessions.

Godot-Patch-Topic: runtime.process-api
---
